    "Verify": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View Source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看源代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning! This profile uses a custom locale that doesn't use UTF-8 as its character encoding, but your profile *is* using UTF-8. This can cause error messages and non-ASCII text to appear wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告！此配置文件使用的自定义语言环境不使用 UTF-8 作为字符编码，但你的配置文件*确实*使用 UTF-8。这可能导致错误消息和非 ASCII 文本显示异常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web Page Alert": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web Page Confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web Site": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you trying to do? I'll suggest commands and explain their output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想做什么？我会建议命令并解释其输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What dependency would you like to add?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想添加哪个依赖项？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What gets changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要更改的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is a Workgroup?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么是工作组？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, only the most recent status from each workgroup is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，仅显示每个工作组的最新状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When iTerm2 is excluded from the dock, you can always get back to Preferences using the status bar item. Look for an iTerm2 icon on the right side of your menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 iTerm2 从 Dock 中排除时，你始终可以通过状态栏项目回到“设置”。请查看菜单栏右侧的 iTerm2 图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When set, the trigger fires only for the workgroup leader (the session that originally entered the workgroup). Peers such as the Code Review and Diff sessions do not, so reloading or quitting one keeps the workgroup open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置后，触发器仅在工作组主导者（最初进入工作组的会话）上触发。代码审查和差异等对等会话不会触发，因此重新载入或退出其中一个会话不会关闭工作组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you check “Remember my choice” or “Suppress this message ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你勾选“记住我的选择”或“抑制此消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where would you like to save this download?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想将此下载存储到哪里？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While attaching to tmux, some tabs were found whose color is pure red. This may be due to a bug in early versions of iTerm2 3.6.x. Would you like to reset those tabs’ colors?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附加到 tmux 时，发现某些标签页的颜色为纯红色。这可能是 iTerm2 3.6.x 早期版本中的 bug 所致。要重置这些标签页的颜色吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While loading %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "载入 %@ 时：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While parsing %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解析 %@ 时：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workgroup name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作组名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can choose to use both, so that your file name ends in “.%@.%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以选择同时使用两者，这样文件名将以“.%@.%@”结尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can find this feature under Edit > Replace Selection > Replace with Pretty-Printed JSON if you want to use it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你想再次使用此功能，可以在“编辑 > 替换所选内容 > 替换为格式化 JSON”下找到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't customize that button": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不能自定义该按钮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have asked to downgrade to an older Python version. Dependencies will need to be reinstalled. This may go badly. Are you sure you want to do this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已请求降级到较旧的 Python 版本。依赖项需要重新安装。这可能不太顺利。确定要这样做吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have asked to upgrade to a newer Python version. Dependencies will need to be reinstalled. OK to continue?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已请求升级到较新的 Python 版本。依赖项需要重新安装。继续吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must enable AI features to use Codecierge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须启用 AI 功能才能使用 Codecierge。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must install Rosetta 2 in order to use the Python API. Install it now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使用 Python API，你必须安装 Rosetta 2。立即安装？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须重启 iTerm2 才能使此更改生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must restart iTerm2 to turn on this feature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须重启 iTerm2 才能开启此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need an open terminal window to make a screenshot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你需要一个打开的终端窗口才能截屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You probably don’t want to turn this on. It will confuse interactive programs. You might want it if you work mostly with East Asian text combined with legacy or mathematical character sets. Are you sure you want this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可能不想开启这个。它会混淆交互式程序。如果你主要处理结合了传统或数学字符集的东亚文本，你可能会需要它。确定要这样吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You probably don’t want to turn this on. It's not suitable for keeping ssh sessions alive, even with a code of “0”. Are you sure you want this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可能不想开启这个。它不适合保持 ssh 会话存活，即使使用代码“0”也是如此。确定要这样吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're about to paste a string with tabs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你即将粘贴包含制表符的字符串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion device is paired and connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Companion 设备已配对并连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion device is paired but iTerm2 isn’t listening for it yet. Reconnecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Companion 设备已配对，但 iTerm2 尚未开始监听。正在重新连接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion device is paired. Waiting for it to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Companion 设备已配对。正在等待其连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re up to date!": {
      "localizations": {
