          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若留空，标签页将采用活动会话的标题。用 \\(…) 括起来的变量和函数调用将被替换为其计算结果。此插值字符串将在标签页的上下文中求值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this is empty, the window takes the active session’s title. Variables and function calls enclosed in \\(…) will be replaced with their evaluation. This interpolated string is evaluated in the window’s context.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
