            "value": "更新文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What kind of %@ do you want to open?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想打开哪种%@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have dynamic profiles whose “Dynamic Profile Parent Name” is set to your hotkey window's profile, “%@.” Because multiple hotkey windows are now supported, the hotkey will now toggle a separate window for each of these profiles. Please update your dynamic profiles appropriately. The affected profiles are:\n%@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你有一些动态配置文件，其“Dynamic Profile Parent Name”设置为热键窗口的配置文件“%@”。由于现在支持多个热键窗口，热键将为每个此类配置文件分别切换一个窗口。请相应地更新你的动态配置文件。受影响的配置文件为：\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm is not the default handler for %@. Would you like to set iTerm as the default handler?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm 不是 %@ 的默认处理程序。是否要将 iTerm 设为默认处理程序？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can show you a Tip of the Day message to help you learn about its many features. Are you interested?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以向你显示“每日提示”消息，帮助你了解其众多功能。你有兴趣吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 is taking longer than usual to verify your saved windows and tabs. This usually means the system is busy and it’s safe to keep waiting, but a damaged state restoration database could also cause it. You can discard the saved windows instead if you’d rather not wait.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 验证已存储的窗口和标签页所花的时间比平时更长。这通常意味着系统繁忙，继续等待是安全的，但状态恢复数据库损坏也可能导致此情况。如果你不想等待，可以改为丢弃已存储的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2's Application Support directory has changed.\n\nPreviously, both these directories were supported:\n~/Library/Application Support/iTerm\n~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2.\n\nNow, only the iTerm2 version is supported. But you have files in both so please move everything from iTerm to iTerm2.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 的 Application Support 目录已更改。\n\n以前，以下两个目录均受支持：\n~/Library/Application Support/iTerm\n~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2。\n\n现在仅支持 iTerm2 版本。但两个目录中都有你的文件，因此请将所有文件从 iTerm 移到 iTerm2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
