    "Value:": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable for reasoning models with a thinking mode, such as GPT-5, o-series, or DeepSeek models, so the chat’s Think toggle appears.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为具有思考模式的推理模型（如 GPT-5、o 系列或 DeepSeek 模型）启用，以便在聊天中显示“思考”开关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prompt must contain the substring %@. %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示词必须包含子字符串 %@。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hotkey Window Successfully Configured": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已成功配置热键窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new profile called “%@” was created for you. It is tuned to work well for the Hotkey Window feature and it can be customized in the Profiles tab.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已为你创建名为“%@”的新配置文件。它针对热键窗口功能进行了调优，可在“配置文件”标签页中自定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Emulate US Keyboard": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模拟美式键盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some keyboard layouts (such as AZERTY) require a modifier to press a number key. This causes problems for switching to a window, tab, or split pane by pressing modifier+number: you might need other modifiers or conflicting modifiers. When “Emulate US Keyboard” is enabled, you can press the configured modifier plus the key on the top row that corresponds to a number key on a US keyboard. For example, on AZERTY, the & key would act as the 1 key.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某些键盘布局（如 AZERTY）需要按住修饰键才能按下数字键。这会导致通过修饰键+数字键切换窗口、标签页或分屏时出现问题：你可能需要其他修饰键，或出现修饰键冲突。启用“模拟美式键盘”后，你可以按下配置的修饰键加上美式键盘顶行中与数字键对应的按键。例如，在 AZERTY 键盘上，& 键将充当 1 键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't save to “%@” on %@: %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法存储到 %@ 上的“%@”：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't convert profile to JSON: %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将配置文件转换为 JSON：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't convert one or more profiles to JSON. Check Console.app for errors.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法将一个或多个配置文件转换为 JSON。请检查“控制台”应用中的错误。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected profile, “%@”, is a dynamic profile. These are generally only edited by hand.\n\niTerm2 is now able to write changes back to dynamic profiles when they are marked as “rewritable“. Rewriting can cause the order of values to change.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选配置文件“%@”是动态配置文件。此类文件通常只能手动编辑。\n\niTerm2 现在可以在动态配置文件被标记为“可重写”时，将更改写回这些配置文件。重写可能导致值的顺序发生变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
