          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确定要在 shell 提示符处粘贴 %d 行？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK to paste %d lines?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确定要粘贴 %d 行？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK to paste one line ending in a newline at shell prompt?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确定要在 shell 提示符处粘贴以换行符结尾的单行？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK to paste one line ending in a newline?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确定要粘贴以换行符结尾的单行？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm Multi-Line Paste": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认多行粘贴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type directly to the terminal (for example to answer a password prompt) instead of queueing your keystrokes until the paste finishes.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接输入到终端（例如回答密码提示），而不是将按键排入队列直到粘贴完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ byte%@ in %@ line%@.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 字节%@，共 %@ 行%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs->%@ spcs": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tabs->%@ 空格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problem with Application Support Directory": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用程序支持目录出现问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problem Creating Config Folder": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建配置文件夹时出现问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "否"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Economy Model. A cheaper model used for frequent background jobs like command-safety checks and screen-idle detection.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换经济模型。一种更便宜的模型，用于频繁的后台任务，例如命令安全检查与屏幕空闲检测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uncheck for models that reject a temperature parameter, such as Anthropic Opus 4.7 and later.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对于拒绝温度参数的模型（例如 Anthropic Opus 4.7 及更高版本），请取消选中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings at %@ changed since iTerm2 started. Overwrite it?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自 iTerm2 启动以来，%@ 处的设置已更改。覆盖它？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you activate Semantic History on a filename, the associated app loads the file.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对文件名激活语义历史记录时，关联的应用会载入该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shell integration needs a newer version of bash.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shell 集成需要更新版本的 bash。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Default": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换默认值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "   %@": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "   %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Shell Integration": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于 Shell 集成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To use shell integration features such as Command History, Recent Directories, Select Output of Last Command, and Automatic Profile Switching, your shell must be properly configured.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使用 Shell 集成功能（如命令历史、最近的目录、选择最后一条命令的输出以及自动配置文件切换），你的 shell 必须正确配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use System Browser": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用系统浏览器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair an iPhone running iTerm2 Buddy to use this.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使用此功能，请将运行 iTerm2 Buddy 的 iPhone 与 Mac 配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open iTerm2 Buddy on your paired iPhone (update it if needed).": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在已配对的 iPhone 上打开 iTerm2 Buddy（如有需要请更新）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts will be delivered to your paired iPhone.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒将发送到已配对的 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on notifications for iTerm2 Buddy in iOS Settings.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iOS 设置中打开 iTerm2 Buddy 的通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on to allow notifications on your iPhone.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开此选项以允许在 iPhone 上接收通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some key reporting modes support additional modifiers of Hyper, Meta, and Super.\n\nA key mapped to one Hyper, Meta, or Super will work normally when the current key reporting mode does not support extended modifiers.\n\nRefer to the manuals for individual applications to see if they support these modifiers and how to configure them.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某些按键报告模式支持 Hyper、Meta 和 Super 等附加修饰键。\n\n映射到某个 Hyper、Meta 或 Super 修饰键的按键，在当前按键报告模式不支持扩展修饰键时，将正常工作。\n\n请参阅各个应用的文档，了解它们是否支持这些修饰键以及如何配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While this session has keyboard focus, the available Snippets will be limited to those containing all the tags listed in this field.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当此会话获得键盘焦点时，可用的代码片段将限于包含此字段中列出的所有标签的那些代码片段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In most key reporting modes, when reporting special keys like arrows, the ⌥ key may act as either Meta or Alt. Prior to version 3.5.6, iTerm2 used Meta. The default changed to Alt because some programs like Emacs expect it.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在大多数按键报告模式中，报告方向键等特殊按键时，⌥ 键可能充当 Meta 或 Alt。在 3.5.6 版本之前，iTerm2 使用 Meta。默认值已改为 Alt，因为 Emacs 等某些程序期望如此。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This action lets you exempt a keystroke from modifier remapping. For example, if you remap ⌘ to ⌥ but you want ⌘-Tab to work as though ⌘ were unmapped just for that keystroke, you would use this action and set the keyboard shortcut to ⌘-Tab": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作可让某个按键免除修饰键重映射。例如，如果你将 ⌘ 重映射为 ⌥，但希望 ⌘-Tab 在该按键上像未重映射 ⌘ 那样工作，可以使用此操作并将键盘快捷键设为 ⌘-Tab。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This action applies modifier remapping but prevents other programs from seeing the keystroke. For example, if you've swapped ⌘ and ^ and want physical ^-tab to switch tabs in iTerm2 instead of triggering the app switcher: bind ^-tab to this action. The system won't see the remapped ⌘-tab (so no app switcher), but iTerm2 receives it and can switch tabs.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作应用修饰键重映射，但阻止其他程序看到该按键。例如，如果你交换了 ⌘ 和 ^，并希望物理 ^-Tab 在 iTerm2 中切换标签页而不是触发应用切换器：请将 ^-Tab 绑定到此操作。系统不会看到重映射后的 ⌘-Tab（因此不会出现应用切换器），但 iTerm2 会收到它并可以切换标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents the keystroke from being sent to the terminal while allowing macOS to handle it normally. For example, if F1 triggers a  macOS Shortcut, binding F1 to Bypass Terminal stops it from sending a control sequence to the terminal but still lets the system shortcut work.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阻止该按键被发送到终端，同时允许 macOS 正常处理它。例如，如果 F1 触发 macOS 快捷指令，将 F1 绑定到“绕过终端”可阻止它向终端发送控制序列，但仍让系统快捷指令正常工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents the keystroke from having any effect within iTerm2. Modifier remapping remains unaffected.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阻止该按键在 iTerm2 内产生任何效果。修饰键重映射不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches tabs in most-recently-used order, like ⌘-Tab in macOS. Hold a modifier and tap repeatedly to walk back through tab history; release the modifier to commit your selection. A single tap with no modifier held jumps to the previously-selected tab, so binding this to a plain key acts as a toggle between the two most recent tabs.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按最近使用顺序切换标签页，类似 macOS 中的 ⌘-Tab。按住修饰键并反复点按可回溯标签页历史；松开修饰键确认选择。不按住修饰键单点按可跳转到上一个选中的标签页，因此将此操作绑定到普通按键可在最近的两个标签页之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches tabs in reverse most-recently-used order. Hold a modifier and tap repeatedly to walk forward through tab history (oldest first); release the modifier to commit your selection. A single tap with no modifier held jumps to the least-recently-used tab.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按最近使用顺序的逆序切换标签页。按住修饰键并反复点按可向前遍历标签页历史（最旧的在前）；松开修饰键确认选择。不按住修饰键单点按可跳转到最久未使用的标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter copy mode commands to move cursor, toggle selection, and so on. This key binding enters Copy Mode and then acts as though you had pressed the keys listed here. [See a list of all the commands](https://iterm2.com/documentation-copymode.html). Use vim syntax for control, option, and function keys (e.g., `<C-x>` or `<Up>`.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入拷贝模式命令以移动光标、切换选择等。此按键绑定进入拷贝模式，然后就像你按下了此处列出的按键一样。[查看全部命令列表](https://iterm2.com/documentation-copymode.html)。使用 vim 语法表示Control 键、Option 键和功能键（例如 `<C-x>` 或 `<Up>`）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can use this to copy information about the current session to the clipboard. [Learn more about interpolated strings](https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以使用此操作将当前会话的信息拷贝到剪贴板。[了解有关插值字符串的更多信息](https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms in the search query are used to prefix search snippet titles, content, and tags.\n\nYou can use the following operators to restrict what attributes of snippets a term searches:\n * `tag:` to search only tags.\n * `title:` to search only snippet titles.\n * `text:` to search only the text of a snippet.\nFor example, `tag:linux`.\n\nTo search only for snippets that do *not* match a term, use the `-` operator. For example, `-linux` or `-tag:linux`.\n\nYou can use `|` as logical OR. For example, `linux|bsd` or `tag:linux|tag:bsd`.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索查询中的词用于按前缀匹配代码片段的标题、内容和标签。\n\n可以使用以下运算符来限制搜索词匹配代码片段的哪些属性：\n * `tag:` 仅搜索标签。\n * `title:` 仅搜索代码片段标题。\n * `text:` 仅搜索代码片段文本。\n例如，`tag:linux`。\n\n要仅搜索不匹配某词条的代码片段，请使用 `-` 运算符。例如，`-linux` 或 `-tag:linux`。\n\n可以使用 `|` 作为逻辑或。例如，`linux|bsd` 或 `tag:linux|tag:bsd`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This histogram shows how much CPU time was used evaluating the regular expression for this trigger over the lifetime of the current terminal session. The X axis gives time in microseconds while the Y axis gives the number of samples which fell in that duration bucket. The vertical red line indicates the mean duration. You can use this to diagnose triggers that cause performance problems.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此直方图显示在触发器的整个生命周期中，计算此触发器的正则表达式所占用的 CPU 时间。X 轴以微秒为单位，Y 轴表示落在该时长区间内的采样数。垂直红线表示平均时长。你可以使用它来诊断导致性能问题的触发器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System window restoration has been disabled, which prevents iTerm2 from respecting this setting. Disable ”System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Close windows when quitting an application“ to enable window restoration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统窗口恢复已被停用，这导致 iTerm2 无法遵循此设置。请停用“系统设置 > 桌面与程序坞 > 退出应用时关闭窗口”以启用窗口恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System window restoration has been disabled, which prevents iTerm2 from respecting this setting. Disable System Settings > General > Close windows when quitting an app to enable window restoration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统窗口恢复已被停用，这导致 iTerm2 无法遵循此设置。请停用“系统设置 > 通用 > 退出应用时关闭窗口”以启用窗口恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开系统设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Preferences": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开系统偏好设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window Restoration Disabled": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口恢复已停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quad-click selects a string under the cursor that best matches a regular expression from a collection of rules.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "四连按选择光标下与规则集合中某条正则表达式最佳匹配的字符串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘-Click on a filename referring to an existing file performs an action on that file.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对指向现有文件的文件名进行 ⌘-点按，可对该文件执行操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any session will switch to this profile automatically when your hostname, username, and current path match one of the rules specified in the adjacent table.\n\nA rule may specify a username, hostname, path, or job. It can also specify combinations of them.\n\nFor example:\n\n * `user@host:/path`\n * `user@`\n * `host`\n * `/path`\n * `&job`\n\nHostnames, paths, and jobs may use `*` wildcards. When a rule that had matched no longer matches (e.g., because the hostname changes), the profile switches back. You can prevent that by adding `!` at the end of the rule. For example, `user@example.com!`.\n\nSee the [documentation](https://iterm2.com/automatic-profile-switching.html) for all the details.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何会话在主机名、用户名和当前路径与相邻表格中指定的一条规则匹配时，都会自动切换到该配置文件。\n\n一条规则可以指定用户名、主机名、路径或任务，也可以指定它们的组合。\n\n例如：\n\n * `user@host:/path`\n * `user@`\n * `host`\n * `/path`\n * `&job`\n\n主机名、路径和任务可以使用 `*` 通配符。当原本匹配的规则不再匹配时（例如主机名更改），配置文件会切换回去。你可以通过在规则末尾添加 `!` 来防止这种情况。例如，`user@example.com!`。\n\n有关所有详细信息，请参阅[文档](https://iterm2.com/automatic-profile-switching.html)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you double-click in the terminal, a single word is selected. When your click is on a letter, the word boundary is found by grouping letters adjacent to the click location. You can extend the set of characters that are treated as belonging to a word with this setting.\n\nFor example, if `/` is considered part of a word, then double clicking on a path would select all the path components.\n\nYou can choose to define the characters considered part of a word with a regular expression. Then you can add specific substrings, such as `https://`, if you would prefer double-clicks on URLs to include the scheme. Generally the regular expression you provide will be a sequence of alternates separated by `|`.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在终端中连按时，会选中一个单词。当点按在字母上时，单词边界通过将点按位置附近的字母分组来确定。你可以使用此设置扩展被视为属于单词的字符集。\n\n例如，如果 `/` 被视为单词的一部分，则连按路径会选中所有路径组件。\n\n你可以选择使用正则表达式来定义被视为单词一部分的字符。然后可以添加特定的子字符串，例如 `https://`，如果你希望连按 URL 时包含协议的话。通常你提供的正则表达式是以 `|` 分隔的备选项序列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, modifiers are remapped in a way that affects system shortcuts and third-party apps that receive keystrokes in the background. For example, if you remap the  ⌥ to ⌘ and **Remap modifiers globally** is enabled then you could press ⌥-Tab to switch apps.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，修饰键将以影响系统快捷键和接收后台按键的第三方应用的方式重映射。例如，如果你将 ⌥ 重映射为 ⌘，且启用了“全局重映射修饰键”，则你可以按 ⌥-Tab 来切换应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when shell integration detects a new prompt.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shell 集成检测到新提示符时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a command exits. Requires shell integration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令退出时触发。需要 Shell 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when the working directory changes.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作目录更改时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when connecting to a different host via SSH.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 SSH 连接到另一台主机时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when the current user changes (su/sudo).": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前用户更改时触发（su/sudo）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when no output is received for the specified duration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在指定时长内未收到输出时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when output resumes after being idle.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲后恢复输出时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when the session terminates.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话终止时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a terminal bell (\\a) is received.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收到终端响铃（\\a）时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a command runs longer than the threshold.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令运行时间超过阈值时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a specific OSC escape sequence is received.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收到特定 OSC 转义序列时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a notification is posted by a control sequence (OSC 9).": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制序列（OSC 9）发出通知时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a progress bar appears or disappears.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "进度条出现或消失时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a process matching the job filter enters the foreground-job ancestry chain.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配作业过滤器的进程进入前台作业祖先链时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a process matching the job filter leaves the foreground-job ancestry chain.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配作业过滤器的进程离开前台作业祖先链时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fires when a session variable changes to a value matching the regex.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话变量更改为匹配正则表达式的值时触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter SGR codes. See help button for details.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入 SGR 代码。有关详细信息，请参阅帮助按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sequence of SGR codes specifying the style to apply. Codes are delimited by semicolons. For example, to change text to be bold and red you’d use `1;31`. You may use the following codes:\n\n```\nNumeric Code    Description\n------------    --------------------------\n           0    Normal (default         \n\n           1    Bold\n           2    Faint\n          22    Reset bold and faint\n\n           3    Italicized\n          23    Not italicized\n\n           4    Single underline\n          21    Doubly underlined\n         4:3    Curly underline\n          24    Not underlined\n\n58:2:1:R:G:B    24-bit underline color. \n                R, G, and B are values in 0…255.\n      58:5:I    8-bit underline color. \n                I is a value in 0…255.\n\n           5    Blink\n          25    Reset blink\n\n           7    Inverse\n          27    Reset inverse\n\n           8    Invisible\n          28    Reset invisible\n\n           9    Crossed-out\n          29    Not crossed-out\n\n          30    Black text color\n          31    Red text color\n          32    Green text color\n          33    Yellow text color\n          34    Blue text color\n          35    Magenta text color\n          36    Cyan text color\n          37    White text color\n          39    Default text color\n\n          40    Black background color\n          41    Red background color\n          42    Green background color\n          43    Yellow background color\n          44    Blue background color\n          45    Magenta background color\n          46    Cyan background color\n          47    White background color\n          49    Default background color\n\n          90    Bright Black text color\n          91    Bright Red text\n          92    Bright Green text color\n          93    Bright Yellow text color\n          94    Bright Blue text color\n          95    Bright Magenta text color\n          96    Bright Cyan text color\n          97    Bright White text color\n\n         100    Bright Black background color\n         101    Bright Red background\n         102    Bright Green background color\n         103    Bright Yellow background color\n         104    Bright Blue background color\n         105    Bright Magenta background color\n         106    Bright Cyan background color\n         107    Bright White background color\n\n38:2:1:R:G:B    24-bit text color. \n                R, G, and B are values in 0…255.\n48:2:1:R:G:B    24-bit background color. \n                R, G, and B are values in 0…255.\n      38;5;I    8-bit text color. \n                I is a value in 0…255.\n      48;5;I    8-bit background color. \n                I is a value in 0…255.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于指定应用样式的 SGR 代码序列。代码以分号分隔。例如，要将文本改为粗体和红色，请使用 `1;31`。你可以使用以下代码：\n\n```\n数字代码        说明\n------------    --------------------------\n           0    Normal (default         \n\n           1    Bold\n           2    Faint\n          22    Reset bold and faint\n\n           3    Italicized\n          23    Not italicized\n\n           4    Single underline\n          21    Doubly underlined\n         4:3    Curly underline\n          24    Not underlined\n\n58:2:1:R:G:B    24-bit underline color. \n                R, G, and B are values in 0…255.\n      58:5:I    8-bit underline color. \n                I is a value in 0…255.\n\n           5    Blink\n          25    Reset blink\n\n           7    Inverse\n          27    Reset inverse\n\n           8    Invisible\n          28    Reset invisible\n\n           9    Crossed-out\n          29    Not crossed-out\n\n          30    Black text color\n          31    Red text color\n          32    Green text color\n          33    Yellow text color\n          34    Blue text color\n          35    Magenta text color\n          36    Cyan text color\n          37    White text color\n          39    Default text color\n\n          40    Black background color\n          41    Red background color\n          42    Green background color\n          43    Yellow background color\n          44    Blue background color\n          45    Magenta background color\n          46    Cyan background color\n          47    White background color\n          49    Default background color\n\n          90    Bright Black text color\n          91    Bright Red text\n          92    Bright Green text color\n          93    Bright Yellow text color\n          94    Bright Blue text color\n          95    Bright Magenta text color\n          96    Bright Cyan text color\n          97    Bright White text color\n\n         100    Bright Black background color\n         101    Bright Red background\n         102    Bright Green background color\n         103    Bright Yellow background color\n         104    Bright Blue background color\n         105    Bright Magenta background color\n         106    Bright Cyan background color\n         107    Bright White background color\n\n38:2:1:R:G:B    24-bit text color. \n                R, G, and B are values in 0…255.\n48:2:1:R:G:B    24-bit background color. \n                R, G, and B are values in 0…255.\n      38;5;I    8-bit text color. \n                I is a value in 0…255.\n      48;5;I    8-bit background color. \n                I is a value in 0…255."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggers are actions you configure to run when certain URLs are visited or text on a web page is found.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发器是你配置的操作，当访问特定 URL 或在网页上找到文本时运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggers watch for text matching a regular expression to arrive in a terminal session and then perform an action in response.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发器监视与正则表达式匹配的文本到达终端会话，然后执行相应的操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coprocess is running.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在运行协同进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Chats can view or control this session.\n * [Unlink from AI Chat](iterm2:unlink-session-chat?s=%@&t=%@)\n * [Reveal AI Chat](iterm2:reveal-chat-for-session?s=%@&t=%@)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 聊天可以查看或控制此会话。\n * [取消与 AI 聊天关联](iterm2:unlink-session-chat?s=%@&t=%@)\n * [显示 AI 聊天](iterm2:reveal-chat-for-session?s=%@&t=%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All output is currently suppressed.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前所有输出均被抑制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commands run in this session are automatically sent to an AI chat, along with their output. [Stop sending](iterm2:disable-streaming-session-chat?s=%@&t=%@)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此会话中运行的命令及其输出会自动发送到 AI 聊天。[停止发送](iterm2:disable-streaming-session-chat?s=%@&t=%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debug logging is enabled.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调试日志已启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filtering.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在过滤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In copy mode. See [documentation](https://iterm2.com/documentation-copymode.html) for details.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "处于拷贝模式。详情请参阅[文档](https://iterm2.com/documentation-copymode.html)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In screenshot mode. Close the screenshot panel to return to normal.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "处于截屏模式。关闭截屏面板以恢复正常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard input from another session gets broadcast to this one, but this session is not an input source for broadcasting (anything you type here stays here).": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来自其他会话的键盘输入会广播到此会话，但此会话不是广播输入源（你在这里输入的内容只会保留在此处）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard input gets broadcast to other sessions.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘输入会广播到其他会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard input is being buffered and will be sent when a trigger stops buffering.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘输入正在缓冲，将在触发器停止缓冲后发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Keyboard Entry is enabled because another app has turned it on.\n[Disable this indicator.](iterm2:disable-secure-keyboard-entry-indicator)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安全键盘输入已启用，因为其他 App 已将其开启。\n[停用此指示器。](iterm2:disable-secure-keyboard-entry-indicator)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Secure Keyboard Entry is enabled. Select iTerm2 > Secure Keyboard Entry to disable.\n[Disable this indicator.](iterm2:disable-secure-keyboard-entry-indicator)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用安全键盘输入。选择 iTerm2 > 安全键盘输入以停用。\n[停用此指示器。](iterm2:disable-secure-keyboard-entry-indicator)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Showing alerts with remembered selections. Disable in iTerm2 > Suppressed Alerts.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在显示带已记住选项的提醒。请在 iTerm2 > 已抑制的提醒中停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Hotkey Window is pinned.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此热键窗口已固定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This command is running within another session.\n * [Return to Enclosing Session](iterm2:pop-channel?s=%@&t=%@)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此命令正在另一个会话中运行。\n * [返回所属会话](iterm2:pop-channel?s=%@&t=%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a maximized split pane.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一个已最大化的分屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will alert on next mark.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将在下一个标记出现时提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoomed in.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已放大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "## Command Selection\n\nWhen you click on a command in a terminal, it becomes “selected”. iTerm2 draws selected commands with an outline and dims non-selected commands. Some features, like Search and Filter, then operate only on the selected command. \n\nYou can disable this feature with “Disable Command Selection” in the settings menu from which you opened this Help window. If you’d like to re-enable it later, search app Settings for “Clicking: on a command selects it.”\n": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "## 命令选择\n\n当你在终端中点按命令时，该命令会变为“已选中”。iTerm2 会以轮廓显示选中的命令，并淡化未选中的命令。某些功能（如搜索和过滤）随后仅对选中的命令生效。\n\n你可以通过打开此帮助窗口的设置菜单中的“停用命令选择”来停用此功能。如果你想稍后重新启用，请在应用设置中搜索“点按：选择命令”。\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to Set": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按以设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invoke Script Function…": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调用脚本函数…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste from Clipboard…": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从剪贴板粘贴…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste from Selection…": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从所选内容粘贴…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Extend Selection": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展所选内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open URL/Semantic History": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 URL/语义历史记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open URL in background": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在后台打开 URL"
