            "value": "用力点按"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The leader behaves like a modifier key, such as Command or Option, but is a separate keystroke. It can be used in key bindings. For example, if you set the leader to ⌘b then you could bind an action to the two-keystroke sequence “⌘b x”. ⌘b is the recommended leader and that keystroke will not be used for other purposes in the future.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leader 键的行为类似修饰键（如 Command 或 Option），但它是一个独立的按键。它可用于按键绑定。例如，如果你将 leader 设置为 ⌘b，则可以将某个操作绑定到“⌘b x”这个双按键序列。⌘b 是推荐的 leader，且该按键将来不会用于其他用途。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "as the leader": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用作 leader"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "as a hotkey": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用作热键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "as the Open Quickly hotkey": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用作快速打开的快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Special characters are:\n* \\<1-to-3-digit octal>\n* \\x<1 or 2 digit hex>\n* \\u<4 digit hex>\n* \\b for backspace\n* \\e for esc\n* \\f for formfeed\n* \\n for newline and \\r for return\n* \\t for tab\n* \\\\ and \\\" for literal \\ and \"\n* <C-x> for control key\n* <M-x> for meta key.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "特殊字符包括：\n* \\<1-to-3-digit octal>\n* \\x<1 or 2 digit hex>\n* \\u<4 digit hex>\n* \\b 表示退格\n* \\e 表示转义\n* \\f 表示换页\n* \\n 表示换行，\\r 表示回车\n* \\t 表示制表符\n* \\\\ 和 \\\" 表示字面反斜杠和引号\n* <C-x> 表示 Control 键\n* <M-x> 表示 Meta 键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C-Style Backslash Escaping supports: \\a (bell), \\b (backspace), \\e (escape), \\n (newline), \\r (carriage return), \\t (tab), \\\\ (backslash), and \\x followed by two hex digits giving a single byte of UTF-8.\n\nUnescaped Literal Text does not have any special characters.\n\nBackward Compatibility Escaping, which is not recommended for new snippets, supports: \\n (newline), \\e (escape), \\a (bell), and \\t (tab).\n\n": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C 风格反斜杠转义支持：\\a（提示音）、\\b（退格）、\\e（转义）、\\n（换行）、\\r（回车）、\\t（制表符）、\\\\（反斜杠），以及 \\x 后跟两位十六进制数字以表示单个 UTF-8 字节。\n\n未转义的文本没有任何特殊字符。\n\n不推荐新片段使用的向后兼容转义支持：\\n（换行）、\\e（转义）、\\a（提示音）和 \\t（制表符）。\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
