    "➡ Select “Continue” to update": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "➡ 选择“继续”以更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 tip of the day": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 每日小贴士"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pane is locked. It cannot be moved, swapped, or dragged, and closing it requires confirmation. Right-click to unlock.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此窗格已锁定。它无法移动、交换或拖拽，关闭时需要确认。右键点按可解锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Problem Saving Debug Log": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储调试日志时出现问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This panel helps you configure a new profile that will be bound to a keystroke you assign. Pressing the hotkey (even when iTerm2 is not active) will toggle a special window.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此面板可帮助你配置一个绑定到你指定的按键的新配置文件。按下热键（即使 iTerm2 未处于活跃状态）将切换一个特殊窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This already-running session was restored but its contents were not saved.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个已在运行的会话已恢复，但其内容未存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select %@.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a session is archived, a full-fidelity copy of it gets saved to disk. You can view archives under the menu item Shell > Archives.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话归档时，其完整副本会存储到磁盘。你可以在“Shell > 归档”菜单项下查看归档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, anything you type just after creating a session with this profile will be stored to be sent later. In order to stop buffering, you may either select the menu item Shell > Toggle Buffer Input, or you can add a Trigger with the action “Buffer Input…” configured to “Stop Buffering Input” to allow buffered input to be sent and keyboard interaction to work normally.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，使用此配置文件创建会话后你输入的任何内容都将存储起来以便稍后发送。要停止缓冲，你可以选择菜单项“Shell > 切换缓冲输入”，或添加一个触发器，操作设为“缓冲输入…”“停止缓冲输入”，以允许缓冲输入被发送并正常使用键盘交互。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "< Tags": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "< 标签"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tags >": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签 >"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete Preset…": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除预设…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visit Online Gallery": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访问在线图库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dark Background": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "深色背景"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High Contrast": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高对比度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light Background": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浅色背景"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pastel (Dark Background)": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "柔和（深色背景）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feature requires shell integration to be installed. <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-shell-integration.html\">Learn more.</a>": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能需要安装 Shell 集成。<a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-shell-integration.html\">了解更多</a>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\nPress any key to dismiss this message.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n按任意键关闭此消息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Splits the current session vertically, placing a new session in the right half. The new session inherits the profile of the current session, including any changes made in `Session > Edit Session`.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "垂直拆分当前会话，将新会话放置在右半部分。新会话继承当前会话的配置文件，包括在 `Session > Edit Session` 中进行的任何更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Splits the current session horizontally, placing a new session in the bottom half. The new session inherits the profile of the current session, including any changes made in `Session > Edit Session`.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平拆分当前会话，将新会话放置在下半部分。新会话继承当前会话的配置文件，包括在 `Session > Edit Session` 中进行的任何更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prompts you to select a profile and then splits the current session vertically, placing the new session in the right half.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示你选择配置文件，然后垂直拆分当前会话，将新会话放置在右半部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prompts you to select a profile and then splits the current session horizontally, placing the new session in the bottom half.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示你选择配置文件，然后水平拆分当前会话，将新会话放置在下半部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **tmux Dashboard** helps you switch between tmux sessions, show and hide windows, and administer other features of tmux without needing to use tmux’s commands.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**tmux 仪表盘** 帮助你切换 tmux 会话、显示和隐藏窗口，以及管理 tmux 的其他功能，无需使用 tmux 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Advanced Paste** lets you edit text before pasting, remove control characters, convert tabs, base64-encode, and perform regular expression substitutions. It also lets you fine-tune how quickly pasted text is sent.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**高级粘贴** 让你在粘贴前编辑文本、移除控制字符、转换制表符、进行 base64 编码，以及执行正则表达式替换。你还可以微调粘贴文本的发送速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Render Natively** shows a nicely formatted, syntax-highlighted rendition of a document. For example, Markdown renders beautifully. It also allows for horizontal scrolling, making it a convenient way to view log files.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**原生渲染** 以格式美观、语法高亮的方式呈现文档。例如，Markdown 会渲染得非常漂亮。它还支持水平滚动，方便查看日志文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be prompted any time you paste text containing a newline. See also **Limit Multi-Line Paste Warning to Shell Prompt**.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只要粘贴包含换行的文本，你就会收到提示。另请参阅 **仅当在 Shell 提示符时对多行粘贴发出警告**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is effective only when **Warn Before Multi-Line Paste** is enabled. It also requires Shell Integration. When enabled, it suppresses confirmation when pasting text containing a newline if you are not at a shell prompt.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当启用 **粘贴多行前发出警告** 时此选项才生效，并且需要 Shell 集成。启用后，当你不在 shell 提示符处时，粘贴包含换行的文本将不再出现确认提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If enabled, you’ll be prompted to confirm that you wish to send a newline when pasting a single line of text ending in a newline. Shell Integration is required.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，当你粘贴以换行结尾的单行文本时，将提示你确认是否要发送换行。需要 Shell 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When selected at a shell prompt (provided Shell Integration is installed) or in the Composer, it sends the current command to the configured AI system along with a prompt for it to generate a command. If no input is provided, you’ll be asked to give instructions. The generated command goes into the Composer.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你在 shell 提示符处（需已安装 Shell 集成）或在 Composer 中选中它时，它会将当前命令连同要求生成命令的提示一起发送给所配置的 AI 系统。如果未提供任何输入，系统会要求你给出指示。生成的命令会放入 Composer。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is meant to be used at the shell prompt after executing a command. It requires Shell Integration. The output of the preceding (or selected) command is sent to AI, which annotates the output and opens a chat window for further discussion.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能用于在 shell 提示符处执行命令之后，需要已安装 Shell 集成。前一条（或选中的）命令的输出会发送给 AI，AI 会对输出加以标注，并打开聊天窗口供你进一步讨论。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snippets are pieces of text that you save to reuse later. They’re great for frequently used commands, hard-to-remember directories, and much more.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码片段是你保存起来供日后复用的文本。它们非常适合存放频繁使用的命令、不易记住的目录等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions are saved instructions for iTerm2. For example, you could create an action that opens a new window and then creates a split pane.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作是为 iTerm2 保存的指令。例如，你可以创建一个操作，先打开一个新窗口，再创建一个拆分窗格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records the current width of the toolbelt for use in newly created windows.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录工具箱的当前宽度，以供新建的窗口使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, dividers rendered by programs like vim or emacs are detected, and text selection wraps around them.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，会检测 vim 或 emacs 等程序绘制的分隔线，文本选择将绕过分隔线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Filter** allows you to hide any lines that do not match a search query, which can be a substring or regular expression. It updates live as new text arrives.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**过滤器**可让你隐藏所有与搜索查询不匹配的行，搜索查询可以是子字符串或正则表达式。随着新文本的到达，它会实时更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A **Mark** appears as a blue triangle in the left margin. You can easily navigate among marks using **Jump to Mark**, **Next Mark**, and **Previous Mark**. If Shell Integration is enabled, a Mark is automatically added at each shell prompt.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**标记**在左边缘显示为蓝色三角形。你可以使用**跳到标记**、**下一个标记**和**上一个标记**轻松地在标记之间导航。如果启用了 Shell 集成，每个 shell 提示符处都会自动添加一个标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A **Named Mark** appears as a blue triangle in the left margin. In addition to being easy to navigate with **Next Mark** and **Previous Mark**, you can also find Named Marks in the Toolbelt’s **Named Marks** tool.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**命名标记**在左边缘显示为蓝色三角形。除了可以用**下一个标记**和**上一个标记**轻松导航之外，你还可以在工具箱的**命名标记**工具中找到命名标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A **Named Mark** appears as a blue triangle in the left margin. In addition to being easy to navigate with **Next Mark** and **Previous Mark**, you can also find Named Marks in this Toolbelt tool.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**命名标记**在左边缘显示为蓝色三角形。除了可以用**下一个标记**和**上一个标记**轻松导航之外，你还可以在此工具箱工具中找到命名标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Fold** lets you collapse multiple lines into a single line to hide distracting text. You can always unfold it by clicking the arrow in the margin, selecting the text and using **Edit > Unfold in Selection**, or right-clicking and choosing **Unfold**.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**折叠**可让你将多行折叠为一行，以隐藏干扰注意力的文本。你可以随时通过点按空白处的箭头、选择文本并使用 **Edit > Unfold in Selection**，或右键点按并选择 **Unfold** 来展开折叠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Captured Output** works in conjunction with a Trigger to detect interesting text in the terminal and make it easy to find. The Toolbelt tool shows a list of captured text. You can click to navigate to it or double-click to enter a programmable command. This is useful for finding errors in the output of a build command, for example. It requires Shell Integration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**捕获输出**与触发器配合使用，用于检测终端中有价值的文本并使其易于查找。工具箱工具会显示捕获文本的列表。你可以点按以跳转到相应位置，或连按以输入可编程命令。例如，这对于查找构建命令输出中的错误很有用。此功能需要 Shell 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Codecierge** uses AI to help you achieve a goal. Tell it what you want to do, and it can watch your terminal to interpret output and suggest commands. Shell Integration is required.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Codecierge** 使用 AI 帮助你实现目标。告诉它你想做什么，它就会观察你的终端，解读输出并建议命令。需要 Shell 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Shell Integration is installed, **Command History** shows a searchable list of recently run commands on the current host.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果安装了 Shell 集成，**命令历史**会显示当前主机上最近运行过的命令的可搜索列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Notes** is a single, persistent notepad in your Toolbelt. It’s useful for keeping track of what you’re doing or composing messages.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**备注**是工具箱中一个可持久保存的记事本。它有助于记录你正在做的事或撰写消息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Paste History** shows text that you have copied and pasted in iTerm2. You can configure it to be saved long term.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**粘贴历史**会显示你在 iTerm2 中复制和粘贴过的文本。你可以将其配置为长期保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows a list of your profiles so you can create new sessions easily.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示你的配置文件列表，方便你轻松创建新会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows your most used directories, sorted by a combination of frequency and recency of use. Requires Shell Integration.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示你最常使用的目录，按使用频率与最近使用时间的组合排序。需要 Shell 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides everything except the lines of selected text to remove distractions.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏除选中文本行以外的所有内容，以排除干扰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights the location of the cursor and unhides it if it is currently hidden.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高亮显示光标位置；如果光标当前处于隐藏状态，则将其取消隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Annotations are inline markup. When closed, they appear as a yellow underline; when open, they look like yellow stickies where you can write memos about content in the terminal window.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注释是行内标记。关闭时，它们显示为黄色下划线；打开时，看起来像是黄色便利贴，你可以在这里写下关于终端窗口中内容的备注。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Composer is a window within the terminal where you can edit text using macOS-native controls. It does syntax highlighting, command and filename completion—even over SSH (provided you use SSH Integration). If AI features are enabled, you can also get AI-powered suggestions. You can even have multiple cursors! When you're ready, you can send the whole buffer or just a line at a time to your shell.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Composer 是终端内的一个窗口，你可以使用 macOS 原生控件编辑文本。它提供语法高亮、命令和文件名补全——即使在 SSH 上也可以（前提是你使用 SSH 集成）。如果启用了 AI 功能，你还可以获得 AI 驱动的建议。你甚至可以拥有多个光标！准备好后，你可以将整个缓冲区发送到 shell，或一次只发送一行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Auto Composer** replaces your shell prompt with a macOS-native text field. It does syntax highlighting and command and filename completion. You can also enable AI-powered suggestions. Shell Integration is required.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**自动 Composer** 会用 macOS 原生文本字段替换你的 shell 提示符。它支持语法高亮，以及命令和文件名补全。你还可以启用 AI 驱动的建议。需要启用 Shell 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Open Quickly** provides quick access to many common actions. You can use it to find a session by typing its name, directory, hostname, or recent command. You can also use it to switch profiles or create a new window by typing the name of a profile. Restore an arrangement by entering its name. Press `/` to get tips for quick commands.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**快速打开** 可让你快速访问许多常用操作。你可以通过输入名称、目录、主机名或最近的命令来查找会话。你还可以通过输入配置文件名称来切换配置文件或创建新窗口。输入窗口布局的名称即可恢复。按 `/` 可获取快速命令的使用提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Instant Replay** lets you review recent terminal history. It’s handy if something just disappeared from the screen and it isn’t in scrollback history.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**即时回放** 可让你查看最近的终端历史。如果某段内容刚从屏幕上消失，且不在回滚历史中，这个功能就很有用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A **Coprocess** is a program that automates interactions in the terminal. Input to the terminal is redirected to stdin of the coprocess, and its output is sent back to the terminal as though the coprocess were typing.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**协同进程** 是一种自动执行终端交互操作的程序。发送到终端的输入会被重定向到协处理器的标准输入，而它的输出会发送回终端，就像协处理器在输入一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the active coprocess. Input to the terminal is no longer redirected to the coprocess, and its output ceases.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止当前活动的协处理器。发送到终端的输入不再被重定向到协处理器，其输出也随之停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Triggers** are actions the terminal performs automatically when text matching a regular expression is received. For example, you can highlight text or display an alert.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**触发器** 是终端在收到与正则表达式匹配的文本时自动执行的操作。例如，你可以高亮文本或显示提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, control characters are displayed visually rather than being interpreted as usual.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，控制字符将以可视形式显示，而不再像往常一样被解析执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This mode is generally not recommended. **Disambiguate Escape** is a more modern approach.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通常不建议使用此模式。**区分转义** 是更现代的做法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buried sessions are hidden in the **Buried Sessions** menu below and do not appear in any window. These are particularly useful for the session where you initiate tmux integration by running `tmux -CC`.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被埋藏的会话会隐藏在下方 **隐藏的会话** 菜单中，不会出现在任何窗口里。对于通过运行 `tmux -CC` 启动 tmux 集成的会话，这个功能尤其有用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Python REPL opens a window running a special Python interpreter that lets you experiment with iTerm2’s Python API. You can use `await` at the top level of the interpreter.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Python REPL 会打开一个窗口，其中运行着特殊的 Python 解释器，让你可以体验 iTerm2 的 Python API。你可以在解释器的顶层使用 `await`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a UI where you can add, update, or remove pip dependencies of a Python API script.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开一个界面，你可以在其中添加、更新或移除 Python API 脚本的 pip 依赖项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2’s Python Runtime is a large binary package (hundreds of MBs) that enables the Python API by installing a pre-built Python environment that scripts can use.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 的 Python 运行时是一个大型二进制软件包（数百 MB）。它会安装一个可供脚本使用的预构建 Python 环境，从而启用 Python API。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use **Import** to install scripts others have shared with you. These scripts have the `.its` extension.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 **导入** 安装他人与你共享的脚本。这些脚本的扩展名为 `.its`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you want to share Python API scripts, you can export them to an `.its` file. If you have a code signing certificate and private key in your Keychain, you can also sign the `.its` file.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你想共享 Python API 脚本，可以将其导出为 `.its` 文件。如果你的钥匙串中有代码签名证书和私钥，还可以对 `.its` 文件进行签名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View errors and low-level communication between Python API scripts and iTerm2 here.\n\nThe Inspector can be accessed from the Console. It allows you to browse variables in sessions, tabs, and windows.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在此处查看 Python API 脚本与 iTerm2 之间的错误和底层通信。\n\n可以从控制台访问检查器。它允许你浏览会话、标签页和窗口中的变量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Window Arrangements** are a saved record of one or more windows, their tabs, and split panes, including how each pane is configured. They do not include content. They’re a quick way to create a working environment with multiple sessions in various configurations.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**窗口布局**保存一个或多个窗口及其标签页和拆分窗格的记录，包括每个窗格的配置方式，但不包含内容。这是快速创建包含多个会话、配置各异的工作环境的方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Password Manager** helps you keep track of your passwords securely. By default, it stores them in the macOS Keychain, but it can also use 1Password or LastPass.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**密码管理器**可帮助你安全地管理密码。默认情况下，它会将密码存储在 macOS 钥匙串中，但也可以使用 1Password 或 LastPass。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**AI Chats** opens a chat window where you can interact with AI. It can optionally view and control the terminal if you grant it permission.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**AI 聊天**会打开一个聊天窗口，你可以在其中与 AI 交互。如果你授予其权限，它还可以查看并控制终端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A **pinned** Hotkey Window does not close automatically when it loses keyboard focus.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**固定**的热键窗口在失去键盘焦点时不会自动关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks whether the GPU Renderer is currently being used in the active session. This is sometimes useful for debugging.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查当前活动会话是否正在使用 GPU 渲染器。这在调试时有时会很有用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Secure Keyboard Entry** prevents other programs from intercepting your keystrokes in the terminal. However, it also breaks some functionality: other programs cannot activate their windows while this is enabled. For example, the `open` command will still open an app, but it won’t be activated.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**安全键盘输入**可防止其他程序在终端中拦截你的按键。但它也会破坏一些功能：启用后，其他程序无法激活其窗口。例如，`open` 命令仍会打开应用，但该应用不会被激活。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Shell Integration** consists of shell scripts that run when you log in. They inform iTerm2 of where your shell prompt is. This enables dozens of useful features such as command history, directory history, AI features, and more.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Shell 集成**由登录时运行的 shell 脚本组成。它们会告知 iTerm2 你的 shell 提示符所在的位置。这样可以启用数十种有用的功能，例如命令历史、目录历史、AI 功能等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debug logs are saved in memory while this setting is enabled and written to `/tmp/debuglog.txt` when you turn it off. Memory use is capped at about 200MB; if the log grows past that, the oldest entries are discarded so the most recent activity is always kept.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用此设置时，调试日志保存在内存中，关闭后会写入 `/tmp/debuglog.txt`。内存使用上限约为 200MB；若日志超过该上限，最旧的条目将被丢弃，因此始终保留最近的活动记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, anything you type in this window is sent to all sessions in this window.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，你在该窗口中输入的内容会发送给该窗口中的所有会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, anything you type in this tab is sent to all sessions in this tab.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，你在该标签页中输入的内容会发送给该标签页中的所有会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds or removes this session from the set of sessions in this window that have broadcast enabled. When you type in a session with broadcast enabled, the keystrokes are sent to all other sessions in the same window that have broadcast enabled.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将当前会话加入或移出该窗口中已启用广播的会话集合。当你在已启用广播的会话中键入时，按键会发送给同一窗口中其他所有已启用广播的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, prominent red lines are drawn in the background to indicate that text you type is being broadcast to other sessions.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，背景中会绘制醒目的红色线条，提示你输入的文字正在广播给其他会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, typing in this session is broadcast to other sessions in the same broadcast domain. Typing in other sessions sends input only to those sessions.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，在该会话中的输入会广播到同一广播域中的其他会话；在其他会话中输入时，输入内容仅发送给那些会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked windows resist being resized. This can be useful when macOS screws up your windows when connecting or disconnecting displays.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁定的窗口无法调整大小。当 macOS 在连接或断开显示器时弄乱你的窗口布局，此功能会很有用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a window’s layout is locked, its tabs and panes can’t be added, closed, reordered, dragged, or moved to another window, so a stray click or drag can’t rearrange it. Resizing panes, opening new windows, and closing the window still work. This is an alternative to Lock Size; turning one on turns the other off.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口布局锁定时，其标签页和窗格无法添加、关闭、重新排序、拖拽或移动到其他窗口，因此误点或误拖不会打乱其布局。调整窗格大小、打开新窗口和关闭窗口仍然可用。此功能是“锁定大小”的替代方案；启用其中一个会关闭另一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the next time any session in this window changes its status (such as waiting, idle, or busy) an alert is shown and this setting turns itself back off. This is the same toggle as the bell button in the **Session Status** toolbelt tool, which must be open for this to be available.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，该窗口中任何会话下次更改状态（如等待、空闲或忙碌）时都会显示提醒，并且此设置会自动关闭。此开关与**会话状态**工具箱工具中的响铃按钮相同，该工具必须处于打开状态，此功能才可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While Buffer Input is turned on, keyboard input is stored in a buffer. It will be sent when Buffer Input is turned off. You can also configure a trigger to change the Buffer Input setting.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用“输入缓冲”时，键盘输入会存储在缓冲区中，关闭“输入缓冲”后才会发送。你也可以配置触发器来更改“输入缓冲”设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Session Status** tool shows the status of sessions across all tabs. Statuses can be set by the **Set Tab Status** trigger or by programs using a control sequence. Each entry shows the session name, a colored indicator dot, status text, and a keyboard shortcut to jump to that session.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**会话状态**工具显示所有标签页中会话的状态。状态可通过**设置标签页状态**触发器或使用控制序列的程序来设置。每个条目显示会话名称、彩色指示圆点、状态文本，以及跳转到该会话的键盘快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Actions": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Captured Output": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "捕获输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Command History": {
