            "value": "出厂默认设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Toolbelt** provides a versatile, dockable sidebar that offers quick access to frequently used features and information. It supports multiple panels that can be displayed simultaneously, including clipboard history, recently opened directories, command history, a scratchpad for notes, and more.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**工具箱** 提供功能多样、可停靠的侧边栏，方便快速访问常用功能和信息。它支持同时显示多个面板，包括剪贴板历史、最近的目录、命令历史、笔记等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for Updated Runtime": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查运行时更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Python Runtime": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装 Python 运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When mouse reporting is on, horizontal scrolling does not switch tabs.\nHold option while swiping or disable horizontal scroll reporting to switch tabs.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启鼠标报告时，水平滚动不会切换标签页。\n按住 Option 键轻扫，或停用水平滚动报告以切换标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tmux paused this session because too much output was buffered.": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "tmux 因缓冲的输出过多而暂停了此会话。"
