    "Looks like paste bracketing was left on when an ssh session ended unexpectedly or an app misbehaved. Turn it off?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看起来 ssh 会话意外结束或某个应用行为异常后，粘贴括号模式仍处于开启状态。要关闭它吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key reporting mode may have been left in an unusual setting when an ssh session died or an app crashed. Restore?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
