          }
        }
      }
    },
    "REMOTE HOST IDENTIFICATION HAS CHANGED!\n\nThe %@ key fingerprint of host '%@' has changed. It is %@.\n\nSomeone could be eavesdropping on you right now (man-in-the-middle attack)!\nIt is also possible that a host key has just been changed.\nConnect anyway?": {
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远程主机标识已更改！\n\n主机“%@”的 %@ 密钥指纹已更改。现在为 %@。\n\n可能有人正在窃听你的连接（中间人攻击）！\n也可能是主机密钥刚刚被更改。\n仍要连接？"
          }
